name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q1_2025'

question 'A developer needs to process a list of 1,000 transactions to find any that are over $500. Which concept allows them to check every transaction without writing 1,000 lines of code?'

wrong 'Data mutation.'
wrong 'Schema constraints.'
right 'Iteration.'
wrong 'Variable declaration.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 1

Iteration allows a single block of code (a loop) to repeat for every item in a collection, making it the only efficient way to handle large datasets.
MARKDOWN
